    - target: {fileID: 1420863298652569307, guid: 798c6c1b320994c45b10f97d4704a362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _noteContents
      value: "Dear Tony. \nThis is the third time this month I've needed to submit
        a maintenance request for these security doors the circuits that power them
        are messed up everytime I need to <color=green>Open</color> a door I have
        to open the circuit panel and <color=green>manually fix the nodes</color>
        it's getting ridiculous I almost got crushed under a door yesterday because
        another circuit blew.\nLovingly from Aren."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1420863298652569307, guid: 798c6c1b320994c45b10f97d4704a362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _additionalDialogue
